    # LADY_TARBECK @ talk "You are to be like an empty, beautiful statue."
    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "당신은 텅 빈, 아름다운 조각상 같은 존재가 되어야 해요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:194
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_8c2fb965:

    # LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Are we clear? They are interested in the novelty of you, {i}not{/i} you."
    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "분명해요? 그들은 당신의 {i}신기함{/i}에 관심이 있는 거지, {i}당신{/i}에게 관심 있는 게 아니에요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:195
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_64a7f186:

    # "Opening my mouth to say something, no words had escaped my lips before she was suddenly dragging me off down one of the corridors."
    "뭐라 말하려고 입을 열자, 내 입술에서는 아무 말도 나오기 전에 그녀가 갑자기 나를 복도 중 하나로 끌고 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:206
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_b73971ab:

    # "Three women sat carefully around a table, each one dressed more ornately than the other."
    "세 명의 여자가 테이블 주위에 조심스럽게 앉아 있었고, 각자 서로보다 더 화려하게 차려입고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:207
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_470fe9a8:

    # "Lady Tarbeck looked woefully their opposite, reserved and withdrawn with shyness, she seemed much... smaller in their presence."
    "타르벡 부인은 그들의 정반대처럼 보였다. 내성적이고 수줍음에 움츠러든 그녀는, 그들 앞에서 훨씬... 작아 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:208
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_132952cb:

    # "The leader of the trio, and the most beautiful of them, after sipping her tea, gently placed her cup down onto the table before standing."
    "트리오의 리더이자 그들 중 가장 아름다운 여인이 차를 한 모금 마신 후, 조심스럽게 컵을 테이블 위에 내려놓고 일어섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:209
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_0bc99978:

    # "The other two followed, as the central figure smiled at Lady Tarbeck... but it was a smile lacking any warmth."
    "다른 두 명이 따라 일어서자, 중심 인물이 타르벡 부인을 향해 미소 지었다... 하지만 그건 어떤 온기도 없는 미소였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:210
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_03b53a1f:

    # LADY_BELAMORE @ smile "Lady Tarbeck."
    LADY_BELAMORE @ smile "타르벡 부인."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:211
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_fa39528c:

    # LADY_TARBECK @ talk "Lady Belamore."
    LADY_TARBECK @ talk "벨라모어 부인."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:212
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_bf6f53b8:

    # LADY_BELAMORE @ smile "Come, sit with us."
    LADY_BELAMORE @ smile "오세요, 우리와 함께 앉으세요."

