    # "The woman's eyes shifted towards me, the way a cat might look at a mouse that just walked into the room."
    "그 여자의 눈이 나에게로 옮겨졌다, 마치 고양이가 방금 방에 들어온 쥐를 바라보는 듯한 눈빛으로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:214
translate kr qst_TheTarbecks2_enter_manor_6489d903:

    # LADY_BELAMORE @ talk "And this is?"
    LADY_BELAMORE @ talk "그리고 이분은?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheTarbecksPt2/scr_TheTarbecks2.rpy:215
